Description: Elantech I2C diagnostics and bounded recovery
 Elan Guardian records IRQ and evdev activity to distinguish transport,
 kernel-driver, and userspace input failures before changing device state.
 It can recover controllers already bound to elan_i2c without grabbing input
 devices or creating a virtual pointer.
 .
 The package includes guarded resume and consumer monitoring units, a Fortran
 trace classifier, and an optional Rust-core DKMS replacement for elan_i2c.
 DKMS failures do not disable the userspace recovery paths.
